    TYPED               Source of the value of B for calculation
    SHIFT               Number of places to right shift calculation result before output
    OUT                 Position output

CLOCK               Configurable clocks
    ENABLE              Halt and reset on falling edge, enable on rising
    PERIOD              Period of clock output
    WIDTH               Width of clock output
    OUT                 Clock output

COUNTER             Up/Down pulse counter
    ENABLE              Halt on falling edge, reset and enable on rising
    TRIG                Rising edge ticks the counter up/down by STEP
    DIR                 Up/Down direction (0 = Up, 1 = Down)
    TRIG_EDGE           INP trigger edge
    OUT_MODE            Counter OUT update mode (on internal counter value change or on ENABLE falling edge)
    SET                 set current value of a counter
    START               Counter start value
    STEP                Up/Down step value
    MAX                 Rollover value
    MIN                 Value to which counter should rollover to
    CARRY               Internal counter overflow status
    OUT                 Current counter value

DIV                 Pulse divider
    ENABLE              Reset on falling edge, enable on rising
    INP                 Input pulse train
    DIVISOR             Divisor value
    FIRST_PULSE         Where to send first pulse
    OUTD                Divided pulse output
    OUTN                Non-divided pulse output
    COUNT               Internal counter value

FILTER              Filter block modes are Difference and Divider
    ENABLE              Enable event
    TRIG                Trigger event
    INP                 Input data
    MODE                Select operation mode
    READY               Output Ready
    OUT                 Output data
    HEALTH              Error

LUT                 Lookup table
    INPA                Input A
    INPB                Input B
    INPC                Input C
    INPD                Input D
    INPE                Input E
    TYPEA               Source of the value of A for calculation
    TYPEB               Source of the value of B for calculation
